  "message": "I can help with that. To look into your Silver Rewards Card cash back, I’ll need to verify your identity before I access your account. What identifier would you like to use so I can look you up: your Rho-Bank user ID, the email on the account, or your full name? 

Also, please tell me which statement(s) or transaction(s) look incorrect (date range or specific dates/amounts) so I can focus the review.

After you give the identifier I’ll ask you to confirm any 2 of the following to verify: date of birth, email, phone number, or mailing address. If you’d rather not verify now, I can transfer you to a human agent—let me know."
